DTSTART:20260926T130000Z
DTEND:20260926T150000Z
LOCATION:Point State Park\, Downtown Pittsburgh
DESCRIPTION:Kids from toddlers to age 12 can participate in the precursor to the Great Race\, with a Family Fun Run for ages 5-12\, a Tot Trot for ages 4 and under\, and a Diaper Dash for the youngest contestants.\\n\\nhttps://www.kidsburgh.org/11-weekend-events-sept-25-27-you-wont-want-to-miss-most-of-them-free/
