DTEND:20260926T133000Z
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20260927T120000Z
LOCATION:Downtown Pittsburgh (Point State Park finish)
DESCRIPTION:This beloved tradition has kept Pittsburghers moving through the city's streets for 49 years\, with more than 10\,000 participants crossing the finish line in Downtown Pittsburgh\; Saturday features the Junior Great Race while Sunday brings runners tackling the 10K and 5K through Forbes Avenue\, Fifth Avenue and Boulevard of the Allies.\\n\\nhttps://nextpittsburgh.com/events/15-things-to-do-this-weekend-from-the-great-race-to-a-landing-ovation/
